  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Reference Assets:*</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">An unequally weighted basket (the &ldquo;Basket&rdquo;) consisting of the STOXX<SUP>&reg;</SUP> Europe 600 Index (the &ldquo;SXXP Index&rdquo;), the Nikkei 225 Index (the &ldquo;NKY Index&rdquo;) and the S&amp;P/ASX 200 Index (the &ldquo;AS51 Index&rdquo;) (each, a &ldquo;Basket Component&rdquo; and together, the &ldquo;Basket Components&rdquo;) in weighted allocations as set forth in the following table:</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="2" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: center; width: 20%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border: Black 1pt solid; width: 16%; background-color: #D9D9D9; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>Basket Component</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 21%; border-top: Black 1pt solid; border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; background-color: #D9D9D9; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>Bloomberg Ticker</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 15%; border-top: Black 1pt solid; border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; background-color: #D9D9D9; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>Weight</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; width: 16%; border-top: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; background-color: #D9D9D9; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>Initial Component Value</B><SUP>(1)</SUP></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: center">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: center">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-left: Black 1pt solid; border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">SXXP Index</FONT></TD>
